The model was trained on 1700 years of SPI data calculated from precipitation in the CESM control simulation and is only applicable to Eastern Equatorial Africa. Testing was performed on the 1981-2018 period in the EMCWF ERA5 reanalysis. The ECWMF EAR5 data was regridded to match the resolution of the CESM output for testing purposes. 

The model uses the last three months available in the ECMWF ERA5 reanalysis dataset and makes predictions up to 4 months in advance. This setup fixes the input data to the ECMWF ERA5 file. 
